[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m Let's represent \(z\) in its polar form. Since \(|z| = 4\), we can write \(z = 4e^{i\theta} = 4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)\). Substituting this into the expression, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m (75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = (75 + 117i)4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m = 4(75 + 117i)(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m = 4(75\cos\theta + 117i\cos\theta + 75i\sin\theta - 117\sin\theta) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m = 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta + i(117\cos\theta + 75\sin\theta)) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m = 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta + i(117\cos\theta + 75\sin\theta)) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)} \cdot \frac{\cos\theta - i\sin\theta}{\cos\theta - i\sin\theta}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m = 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta + i(117\cos\theta + 75\sin\theta)) + \frac{(96 + 144i)(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta)}{4(\cos^2\theta + \sin^2\theta)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m = 4(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta + i(117\cos\theta + 75\sin\theta)) + \frac{96\cos\theta + 144i\cos\theta - 96i\sin\theta + 144\sin\theta}{4}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m \]
