[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m 4(75 \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta + i (75 \sin \theta + 117 \cos \theta)) + \frac{1}{4}(96 \cos \theta + 144 \sin \theta + i (144 \cos \theta - 96 \sin \theta)).
