[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m (75 + 117i)(4\cos\theta + 4i\sin\theta) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4\cos\theta + 4i\sin\theta}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m Simplify the first term:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m (75 + 117i)(4\cos\theta + 4i\sin\theta) = 4(75 + 117i)(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) = 4[(75\cos\theta - 117\sin\theta) + i(75\sin\theta + 117\cos\theta)]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m 
