[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m Simplify the second term:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=1118835)[0m \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4} \cdot \frac{1}{\cos\theta + i\sin\theta} = 24(1 + \frac{3i}{4}) \cdot \frac{1}{\cos\theta + i\sin\theta} = 24(1 + \frac{3i}{4}) \cdot \frac{\cos\theta - i\sin\theta}{\cos^2\theta + \sin^2\theta} = 24(1 + \frac{3i}{4})(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta)
